I stand in the hallway.
I have a key in my hand.
This is the key to my new flat.
I open the door.
I slowly walk inside.
This is my own home.
I look around the living room.
It is very quiet here.
There is furniture in this room.
A small table sits near the door.
There is a lamp on top of the table.
A large sofa sits in the middle of the room.
A rug lies under the sofa.
A chair also sits near the window.
Good light is coming through the window.
It is the nice January weather in Kochi now.
I take a deep breath.
I like this new flat very much.
